# This file is generated by dune, edit dune-project instead
opam-version: "2.0"
synopsis:
  "A browser application library for OCaml: the Elm architecture with encapsulated components"
description: """
kilim is a browser application library for OCaml 5.5. It uses the Elm architecture: a model, typed messages, a pure update and a view. Components keep their own model, messages, tasks and subscriptions. Async tasks are values with cancel tokens, and an unmount cancels all tasks of a component. kilim performs no OCaml effects. It builds with js_of_ocaml and wasm_of_ocaml in their default modes.

The libraries: kilim (the app, the view, the tasks and the components) with kilim.browser, kilim.testing (a fake DOM, a virtual clock and mocks for native tests), kilim.http (requests, JSON and decoders), kilim.router (routes in the URL path), kilim.websocket, kilim.storage (localStorage and sessionStorage), each with a .browser part, and kilim.web (Web API bindings that Brr does not have). The executable kilim makes the page and the loader of an app, and the release files with content names.

The tests (opam install --with-test) need binaryen 119 or later in PATH for wasm_of_ocaml, and node 22.3.0 or later for the js and wasm runs: with no node, these runs do a skip."""
maintainer: ["Bikal Gurung <gbikal@gmail.com>"]
authors: ["Bikal Gurung <gbikal@gmail.com>"]
license: "MPL-2.0"
tags: ["browser" "web" "elm" "ui" "js_of_ocaml" "wasm_of_ocaml"]
homepage: "https://github.com/ocaml-caravanserai/kilim"
doc: "https://ocaml.org/p/kilim/latest/doc/index.html"
bug-reports: "https://github.com/ocaml-caravanserai/kilim/issues"
depends: [
  "dune" {>= "3.21"}
  "ocaml" {>= "5.5.0"}
  "brr" {>= "0.0.9"}
  "js_of_ocaml-compiler" {>= "6.4.1" & < "7.0"}
  "wasm_of_ocaml-compiler" {with-test & >= "6.4.1" & < "7.0"}
  "windtrap" {with-test & >= "0.3.0"}
  "odoc" {with-doc}
]
build: [
  ["dune" "subst"] {dev}
  [
    "dune"
    "build"
    "-p"
    name
    "-j"
    jobs
    "@install"
    "@runtest" {with-test}
    "@doc" {with-doc}
  ]
]
dev-repo: "git+https://github.com/ocaml-caravanserai/kilim.git"
x-maintenance-intent: ["(latest)"]
